  "title": "run-recon service",
  "description": "One service (scheme, host and port) under a seed, with the values of its representative URL row: the root URL when it was probed, else its smallest URL. The same rule recon-db.sh diff and --monitor use, so change events agree with <out>.delta.tsv. service omits the default port; port is always explicit. Values are the CSV cells as strings, without the CSV's formula guard (no leading apostrophe). An empty cell is an empty string. A field added in a later run-recon release is a minor version: consumers accept unknown string fields.",
